scope mantra lane -- REDS %700's first named repair built and its second refuted by the reading
status GREEN for this lap's own work, with two roster reds named rather than smoothed. Witness mantra_query_wire_flap GREEN on metal. Cold 256 run, 252 green. Hot reds shim_reason and stash_record, neither mine: shim_reason refuses on late_say_rostered=1 in tools/g/gitlink_dependent_witness.rish and carries unsaid_rostered 938 against a ceiling of 936, and giving my own three asserts their target's words moved that count not at all, which is the proof they were never in it. stash_record is REDS %636 -- my own round-open stashed a prior lap's unsent session log at 07:21:45, and the cold pass read that same stash green afterward, which is that row's own title about two gates disagreeing. The port repair is named, unbuilt, and wants Keaton's word among three doors.
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the repair picks among a pid-keyed offset, a bind-to-zero exchange, and dropping SO_REUSEADDR; the first two change how a run finds its peer and the third changes what a collision looks like, and comlink/README.md's closing sentence wants rewriting in the same commit
